{
  "comment": "Import mapping for the AVL Drumkits (SFZ versions), converted as the Basalt Kits pack. The AVL licence asks that a modified version of the library be distributed under a different name, so the pack and its kits are renamed; the credits and licence stay Glen MacArthur's. Each kit is one mono recording per piece, panned in the SFZ, so every piece gets a mic (mixer channel) of its own, panned to match. SFZ pans are from the drummer's seat; they are flipped to the audience's view of the kit stage. The hi-hat and cymbal chokes come from the SFZ's group/off_by settings.",
